---
title: Trip rules (one card's taps, in time order)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> NotRiding

    NotRiding --> Riding : tap ON at stop A
    NotRiding --> NotRiding : tap OFF → Unmatched (no tap on)

    Riding --> NotRiding : tap OFF at stop B → Completed, fare A↔B
    Riding --> NotRiding : tap OFF at stop A → Cancelled, $0.00
    Riding --> Riding : tap ON again → Incomplete, max fare from A
    Riding --> [*] : no more taps → Incomplete, max fare from A
    NotRiding --> [*]

    note right of Riding
        No time limit: a tap off days later
        still completes the trip.
        Bus and company are ignored;
        the trip takes them from the tap on.
    end note

    note left of NotRiding
        Any trip whose stops have no fare
        becomes Unmatched (no fare),
        is logged and is not charged.
    end note
